  "hero_summary_zh": "拉席克强大的魔法可以摧枯拉朽般将敌人和他们的坚塔毁灭。灾难性的敕令让他在敌方领地中长驱直入，把握良机将大地撕裂的能力可以使敌人动弹不得，让无情的盟友将他们一一终结。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Leshrac's powerful spells lay waste to enemies and their defenses alike. Pushing deep into enemy territory with his devastating edict, careful timing of his ability to split the earth will stun foes, allowing his merciless allies to finish them off.",
